{"id":4075,"date":"2025-06-02T03:55:04","date_gmt":"2025-06-02T03:55:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4075"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:25:15","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:25:15","slug":"chi-phi-quang-cao-tiktok-chi-tiet-2025","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/chi-phi-quang-cao-tiktok-chi-tiet-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Chi ph\u00ed ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok chi ti\u1ebft 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"ARpudMnFwoDBYIxXcdali7a9gkb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MQSPdFCUlo0eMox1mjKlvdfcgdc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u00ed quy\u1ebft t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi ph\u00ed t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y t\u1eeb 200.000 \u2013 500.000 VN\u0110 cho nh\u00f3m qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u1ecf. K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, b\u1eaft trend nhanh, ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i s\u00e1t sao k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 s\u1ebd gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch \u0111\u1ea1t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cao nh\u1ea5t, t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c. V\u1eady h\u00e3y c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a>\u00a0xu\u1ed1ng b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u chi ti\u1ebft<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wo3YdlY3LofN9nxprb4lJf3fgKd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OpGAdlzzaoHMDGxHF2tlJONJghf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EUCadIBOgoYfIcxcC5VlNpt5gcb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads l\u00e0 s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea1y c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. Chi ph\u00ed n\u00e0y ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o nhi\u1ec1u y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 nh\u01b0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u (CPC, CPM, CPA), m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u1eafm t\u1edbi, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1eb7t ra. TikTok cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c t\u1ed5ng ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch v\u00ec m\u1ee9c chi ph\u00ed n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh gi\u00fap t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SqypdrQDvoGaiDxTdRkly8Kkgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4082\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4082\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4082\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1.png\" alt=\"TikTok Ads\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4082\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Ads<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"ARpudMnFwoDBYIxXcdali7a9gkb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-K89rdVM9Ro4HY1xznemllw0egSd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UWq2dhxEdo4KdqxV5UPlneZKgKb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tr\u00ean TikTok Ads, c\u00f3 3 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ea5u th\u1ea7u nh\u01b0 sau:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-IicUdwqRroXl1VxBOdAl5g9oglb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ea5u th\u1ea7u v\u00e0 bidding<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RwPrdToqHoEvgzxpgT7lYKIWggg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 th\u1ee9 t\u1ef1 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u t\u1ed1i \u0111a cho m\u1ed7i h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng (nh\u1ea5p chu\u1ed9t, hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb, chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i). TikTok t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng so s\u00e1nh c\u00e1c gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cho c\u1ea3 nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-PBy7dcuNkoyfVWxU746lFvqQgdd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">CPM (Cost Per Mille\/Cost per Thousand Impression) Chi ph\u00ed m\u1ed7i 1.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD3Qd0q6AoQpZQxuqj3lJ7MIgLg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trung b\u00ecnh CPM tr\u00ean TikTok dao \u0111\u1ed9ng kho\u1ea3ng $7 \u2013 $10 (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 160.000 \u2013 230.000 VN\u0110) t\u00f9y v\u00e0o ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 cho m\u1ed7i 1.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn r\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-OGejdNlVgoLi9Ox36Vhl9juDgbc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">CPV (Cost Per View) \u2013 Chi ph\u00ed m\u1ed7i 1.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JvT7dbTVfoLm8lxmSLglawhPgIe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c t\u00ednh theo m\u1ed7i 1.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem. M\u1ee9c CPV trung b\u00ecnh dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb $0.02 \u2013 $0.06\/l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng kho\u1ea3ng 460 \u2013 1.400 VN\u0110. H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c n\u00e0y \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c video ho\u1eb7c truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i n\u1ed9i dung m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u01a1n \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-A1qtd5qoUoGbmcxD5wqlzLB2gUg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">CPC (Cost Per Click) \u2013 Chi ph\u00ed m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FaTTdGaqqojJNJxMC1gluKHQgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, ch\u1eb3ng h\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 li\u00ean k\u1ebft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, website ho\u1eb7c n\u00fat \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd. Tr\u00ean TikTok, CPC trung b\u00ecnh dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb $0.10 \u2013 $0.30, t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng kho\u1ea3ng 2.300 \u2013 7.000 VN\u0110. H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c n\u00e0y \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch nh\u1eafm \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, nh\u01b0 t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, thu h\u00fat l\u01b0\u1ee3t \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd ho\u1eb7c d\u1eabn ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ebfn trang web \u0111\u00edch.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-LRaAd6Z9Iod0hSxFfiilQhQPgwe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">CPM (Optimized Cost per Mille) \u2013 Chi ph\u00ed m\u1ed7i 1.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kc5ddGyduo75vRxA3SMlRbFGgrf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u theo m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, ch\u1eb3ng h\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, l\u01b0\u1ee3t c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t app ho\u1eb7c l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng. Gi\u00e1 th\u01b0\u1eddng cao h\u01a1n CPM th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng, dao \u0111\u1ed9ng kho\u1ea3ng $8 \u2013 $12 (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 185.000 \u2013 280.000 VN\u0110), v\u00ec TikTok s\u1ebd \u01b0u ti\u00ean ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u00f3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng cao th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng mong mu\u1ed1n. H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c n\u00e0y r\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch mu\u1ed1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 thay v\u00ec ch\u1ec9 ch\u1ea1y hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1edbn.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"ARpudMnFwoDBYIxXcdali7a9gkb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XRGrdubuhokjzcxYqnhlSxyGgcd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc<\/h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table class=\"ace-table\" style=\"width: 97.5915%; height: 163px;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"136;684\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"136\" \/>\n<col width=\"684\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 47px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 21.0843%; height: 47px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FNPldvQgtoXJ4mx7IvOl1bK2gzg\"><strong>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u00ednh<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.857%; height: 47px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z5r2d9ZDboZLI1xsT9Slk67mg8g\">L\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1eb7t ch\u1ed7 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 v\u00e0 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o, th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng cho c\u00e1c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TopView ho\u1eb7c Brand Takeover.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 21.0843%; height: 23px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CAIFdvqGbo5W0nxnMUHlEDfkgKg\"><strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.857%; height: 23px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I8JVdzcM5onaYwxhGawlA41egPh\">\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ee7 cao, hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u1edf v\u1ecb tr\u00ed d\u1ec5 th\u1ea5y nh\u1ea5t, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch l\u1edbn, ra m\u1eaft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 21.0843%; height: 23px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CktAdwHLUormPBx39tFlhJPmgPf\"><strong>Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.857%; height: 23px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yg0udZSLMof0CGx1aPnloz6Xgeh\">Chi ph\u00ed r\u1ea5t cao, kh\u00f4ng linh ho\u1ea1t theo hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 47px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 21.0843%; height: 47px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FtXadoFCioMuTvxjLy9ltp9ggvc\"><strong>Chi ph\u00ed<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.857%; height: 47px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DHnHdf5d9o1nYCxvypQlh5Ppguf\">Cao h\u01a1n c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c kh\u00e1c, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00ean t\u1edbi t\u1eeb 1.000 \u2013 150.000 USD\/ng\u00e0y t\u00f9y th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CA5gdLVlDodm2Fxld4Rl8a0EgUc\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n cao.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 21.0843%; height: 23px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SXdrdV2FdoGsW0xMW04l0KZXgZd\"><strong>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.857%; height: 23px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QREudBAFAohzKTxvyDxl3BL4g6g\">Ra m\u1eaft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch l\u1edbn.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><figure id=\"attachment_4077\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4077\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4077\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/23.png\" alt=\"N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/23.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/23-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/23-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/23-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/23-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4077\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VlQudW6R4oCnDPxA2JGlLNMxgGc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MjsBdt5TToWoYMxTHe1lJvM5gTb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t (Reach v\u00e0 Frequency)<\/h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table class=\"ace-table\" style=\"width: 97.5907%;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"136;684\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"136\" \/>\n<col width=\"684\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 22.0482%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fpbud1lMOomW6hxUCkAleNHQgwB\"><strong>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u00ednh<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.344%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2iNdgHkqoZesex9BwNlDmUKgCh\">Gi\u00fap nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o trong m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQand98gTodUIHxma0IlmPo6g9g\">Cho ph\u00e9p l\u00ean l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 d\u1ef1 \u0111o\u00e1n k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng t\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1edbc (kh\u00e1c v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea5u th\u1ea7u m\u1edf).<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 22.0482%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LOGqdvjcXozTUZx1ml8l3h10g9g\"><strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.344%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AV5TdKv41oJuktxdYeBlX4YPgWe\">\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ec1u, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cho chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch branding quy m\u00f4 v\u1eeba v\u00e0 l\u1edbn.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Oyeod44dzoCGCrxFyeMlTTyKgJg\">D\u1ef1 \u0111o\u00e1n ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3, ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ec1u<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 22.0482%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HOKHdGezuoecSRxrmcFl0V3vghh\"><strong>Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.344%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TT9odZMQno2TISx4vNXlAl3UgGe\">Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch cao, t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 22.0482%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NOGYdsm02ob4ptx12p2lxjzjgdg\"><strong>Chi ph\u00ed<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.344%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PdEjdedOuomICRxfdB6lyR6UgOe\">Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u t\u1eeb 20.000.000 VN\u0110 tr\u1edf l\u00ean cho chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rkm9dnCMdopUndxT3FblVD7sg0b\">Kho\u1ea3ng $10 \u2013 $20 (\u2248 230.000 \u2013 470.000 VN\u0110 \/ 1.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb)<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 22.0482%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JYBfd1RmDourXZxD4MPlXIAqgmb\"><strong>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 123.344%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TMYrd3IJloMkfZxZC7MlQwmxgMh\">X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QhVvdMBniotdORx79CNlVuMugNs\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00dd:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NapVdK2EXoiU60xZRxelB9xUgxW\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; B\u1ea1n n\u00ean thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb kho\u1ea3ng 3 l\u1ea7n m\u1ed7i tu\u1ea7n cho m\u1ed7i ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng trong chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch k\u00e9o d\u00e0i t\u1eeb 3 tu\u1ea7n tr\u1edf l\u00ean.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LkHfd92U0o7VdExOEMXlZ1aHgUh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; Vi\u1ec7c v\u01b0\u1ee3t qu\u00e1 t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t 5\u20137 l\u1ea7n hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb m\u1ed7i ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn hi\u1ec7n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ec7t m\u1ecfi qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (ad fatigue), khi\u1ebfn hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch gi\u1ea3m s\u00fat v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed t\u0103ng cao.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LodRdSJunohVxoxpb8HlDa8rghd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WWl9dl3croHa6wxNOm8lApZOg5g\" style=\"text-align: left;\">B\u1ea3ng chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads Lemon Digital<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-TIVcdFdH9o1J9Bx7ghhl0h7igNb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c h\u1ea1ng m\u1ee5c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JlAQdYra8ovBwjxVrx1l3E5WgKd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4080\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4080\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4080\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/28.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1c h\u1ea1ng m\u1ee5c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/28.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/28-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/28-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/28-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/28-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4080\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1c h\u1ea1ng m\u1ee5c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u1ea1i <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C49idyw3Woz4CIxjzIGlSscbgXc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BgrIdQjoio8pjOxcSMFljHsTg7f\" style=\"text-align: left;\">B\u1ea3ng gi\u00e1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads<\/h3>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-RCWRdNtOtoHY6KxTTT4lHyaggsf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;39b83fcb-c6ad-47cd-b8d1-6ac8ff8e8d9d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1963,&quot;width&quot;:3750,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1963,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3750,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1963,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3750,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNEPobFOCgoUj6Yx2bItlJDFDgqd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NEPobFOCgoUj6Yx2bItlJDFDgqd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:948302,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4078\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4078\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4078\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/26.png\" alt=\"B\u1ea3ng gi\u00e1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/26.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/26-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/26-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/26-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/26-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4078\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u1ea3ng gi\u00e1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, n\u1ebfu c\u00f3 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 th\u1eafc m\u1eafc ho\u1eb7c c\u1ea7n t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n th\u00eam,<\/p>\n<p>vui l\u00f2ng li\u00ean h\u1ec7 <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 chi ti\u1ebft.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-YXvLdypRKoZ6nRxIrlWltiRogPf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SGbydoPd9oO39LxDg71l0FIbgFc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>GIAI \u0110O\u1ea0N 1 \u2013 Th\u00e1ng th\u1ee9 1: C\u01a1 b\u1ea3n &amp; t\u1ed1i \u01b0u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong> M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau: T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n Shopee, x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u00e1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u1ea7n c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MWB4dTPSuoMIUDxJ7EmlcwS2gYc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SWmod5L48oZHjqxDrZwlK2GKgpc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 click xem v\u00e0 mua h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JABldHyTEo7IybxRqXAlXc89gbg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn, chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a shop tr\u00ean trang k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CEdBdeYUfoiEU3xRLPZlD4Xzgfb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N4zqdApNUot3Xtxvv0xlOl0lguc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u t\u00ean v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bd5ldEnQ5oAvv2xwZb4l6Ddqgnb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh Key Visual.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-PAkCdCVdpoIxp0xVCRPlXbIwg9b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>GIAI \u0110O\u1ea0N 2 \u2013 Th\u00e1ng th\u1ee9 2: M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng &amp; chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i<\/strong> M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau: M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng l\u01b0u l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o th\u00f4ng qua \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau, th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh mua h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q15Tdqv2GoHe4YxqwmMlTNErgfg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o shop.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E2FFd7DHLoFMh1xavCKluS1qgqc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o trang chi ti\u1ebft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PXN6d4lSooNZshxT90IlvpI0gsh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i mua h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MS2GdGBwto07gSxrqLhlDvWYgMg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u00e1n ra.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BnLZdorLNoZMZ4x5LE3ldw8ygGg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fr0ddoKFeoHHw1xaWv3lQfhZggc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng Commerce Plan.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQ5EdYkr6oE09dxgrmYlNs7ggzh\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ee7 l\u1ef1c (Hero SKU) ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoaHdqBxVovGhsxseBglx1xUgB5\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>L\u1eadp k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch ph\u00e2n b\u1ed5 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDq0dAR3eofirRxKSQslyPS4g6g\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o li\u00ean t\u1ee5c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ExGDd9gvYovFh5x04YflMyujgch\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>GIAI \u0110O\u1ea0N 3 \u2013 Th\u00e1ng th\u1ee9 3: \u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 &amp; ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n<\/strong> M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau: \u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a ra \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n ti\u1ebfp theo.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KNm7d0opFoT4drxPmsglMRIUg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u00e1o c\u00e1o chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00e3 tri\u1ec3n khai.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6iodEHhwoM6YLx13nIlVj2kgPf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>So s\u00e1nh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 sau khi tri\u1ec3n khai qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OiisdtN72oyURfxAXTpl2bivgjh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110o l\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 nh\u01b0 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp, CTR, CR, ROAS \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TI1edZTmDo2nsrxCYXdlNylbgZI\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XJCHd4l9WoLaWbxy9IRlbSEQgGe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>B\u00e1o c\u00e1o k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 GMV v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XtNod2lTroVqB6xysXBlMuxGgce\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>\u0110\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t kinh doanh cho th\u00e1ng ti\u1ebfp theo.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-DpdLd01agoRx3ixJGnXlt2BxgBe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;380a6182-afe3-4aa9-8eab-7d6d6f111e1a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1963,&quot;width&quot;:3750,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1963,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3750,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1963,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3750,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDWgpbpSVqo0mErxRDp4lKpw5gsY%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DWgpbpSVqo0mErxRDp4lKpw5gsY&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2136034,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;380a6182-afe3-4aa9-8eab-7d6d6f111e1a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1963,&quot;width&quot;:3750,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1963,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3750,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1963,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3750,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDWgpbpSVqo0mErxRDp4lKpw5gsY%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DWgpbpSVqo0mErxRDp4lKpw5gsY&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2136034,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4079\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4079\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4079\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/27.png\" alt=\"3 giai \u0111o\u1ea1n ch\u00ednh tri\u1ec3n khai chi ti\u1ebft c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/27.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/27-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/27-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/27-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/27-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4079\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">3 giai \u0111o\u1ea1n ch\u00ednh tri\u1ec3n khai chi ti\u1ebft c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"ARpudMnFwoDBYIxXcdali7a9gkb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8midvmvlo8TbZxjoWrlRrw1gfc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XwSxdKlAhoSiJoxaSy4lRCX6glh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Loofdt5KroTF9Lx2H2DlQDQngKg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o:<\/strong>\u00a0 l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c khi ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok, ch\u1eb3ng h\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 mu\u1ed1n nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, mu\u1ed1n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng b\u1ea5m v\u00e0o xem website, hay mu\u1ed1n h\u1ecd mua h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i th\u00f4ng tin. M\u1ed7i m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau s\u1ebd c\u00f3 chi ph\u00ed kh\u00e1c nhau. Nh\u1eefng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem ho\u1eb7c thu h\u00fat s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f3 chi ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n. Ng\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea1i, c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau nh\u01b0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hay thu th\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd t\u1ed1n nhi\u1ec1u ti\u1ec1n h\u01a1n, v\u00ec TikTok c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i ph\u00e2n t\u00edch v\u00e0 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u01a1n, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0m t\u0103ng chi ph\u00ed.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MzU6davvfo6nPGx6DjklwieMgAm\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau (target audience)<\/strong> Chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok c\u0169ng ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng xem qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau qu\u00e1 c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, v\u00ed d\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng trong \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i t\u1eeb 18\u201324, l\u00e0 n\u1eef, s\u1ed1ng \u1edf th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1 l\u1edbn v\u00e0 c\u00f3 s\u1edf th\u00edch v\u1ec1 th\u1eddi trang, th\u00ec qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o s\u1ebd t\u1ed1n nhi\u1ec1u ti\u1ec1n h\u01a1n. Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n l\u00e0 v\u00ec c\u00e0ng nh\u1eafm \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u00ec m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ea1nh tranh c\u00e0ng cao, TikTok ph\u1ea3i s\u00e0ng l\u1ecdc k\u1ef9 h\u01a1n \u0111\u1ec3 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u0111\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. Ngo\u00e0i ra, chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u0169ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00f9y theo khu v\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd. \u1ede c\u00e1c th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 M\u1ef9 hay ch\u00e2u \u00c2u, chi ph\u00ed th\u01b0\u1eddng cao h\u01a1n so v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng khu v\u1ef1c nh\u01b0 \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1, do l\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nhi\u1ec1u v\u00e0 m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ea1nh tranh cao h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yd4odgGIzo0Twhx0YvrlxVWbgXg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RlJidUjFooY7SKxXj3Wl2K63gZb\">Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n v\u1edbi chi ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n. Ng\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea1i, n\u1ed9i dung k\u00e9m thu h\u00fat c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m t\u0103ng chi ph\u00ed.<\/div>\n<p>TikTok ch\u1ea1y theo h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ea5u gi\u00e1. Gi\u00e1 b\u1ea1n tr\u1ea3 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u1edbi c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00e1c c\u00f9ng target. Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c to\u00e0n chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u0169ng \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1ch TikTok ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X8OQdTx3eo8aCIxWSp4lGN5ngyc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 nh\u1ea5p (CTR) v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<p>TikTok \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c. Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 nh\u1ea5p cao v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i v\u1ec1 gi\u00e1.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UDZudXqdEoAcRhxTRu4la8H3gxb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JmPfdiPj5oCXXAxcSK4llILhg8f\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1eb9o t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok.<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TzXldzsbmoYsfyxNuuclwlpqgCb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh r\u00f5 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong> \u2013 Bi\u1ebft r\u00f5 b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n g\u00ec \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh l\u00e3ng ph\u00ed ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R4TadsSDZoxF94x8WoElajyQgd3\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u1eafm \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong> \u2013 Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7, kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 r\u1ed9ng hay qu\u00e1 h\u1eb9p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y44odBoZPoVgylxKjjulpEI4gcg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn<\/strong> \u2013 Video s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, b\u1eaft trend s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n v\u1edbi chi ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jt5rd8x7XocbVlxb9E8lEcdHgCg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Test A\/B nhi\u1ec1u m\u1eabu<\/strong> \u2013 Th\u1eed c\u00e1c m\u1eabu kh\u00e1c nhau \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn m\u1eabu hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FTLudcEzDoK8ayxHQ0QlrOPzgnb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong> \u2013 Tr\u00e1nh gi\u1edd cao \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ebfu ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch \u00edt.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqIfdyeIyoky3rx5uJllc3uFgjf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean<\/strong> \u2013 T\u1eaft qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o k\u00e9m hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, d\u1ed3n ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch cho c\u00e1i t\u1ed1t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JkfudHDUjo7XV1xNIuelNy9cgpf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch nh\u1ecf<\/strong> \u2013 Test tr\u01b0\u1edbc, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 th\u00ec t\u0103ng d\u1ea7n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-EldZdksHgoZjT8xMhXwloSF4gde\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;87a0f70f-416b-4c20-a9ba-5d67af7a000f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQPXFbuJXroXpd2xDklNliMfkgaf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QPXFbuJXroXpd2xDklNliMfkgaf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:51803,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIsmdpUHAoe4zqxh3sblxD9GgM7\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWR6dBPUlolsuQxoAOIlCRvagkf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SspMdrqhDowPQLxvNxulZVoigke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OXjIdmNdzobSyfxkoq1lDebaghh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEQkdpArzo5mq8xpYTRljsdNgRh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>B\u00ed quy\u1ebft t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi ph\u00ed t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y t\u1eeb 200.000 \u2013 500.000 VN\u0110 cho nh\u00f3m qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u1ecf. K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, b\u1eaft trend nhanh, ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i s\u00e1t sao k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 s\u1ebd gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch \u0111\u1ea1t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cao nh\u1ea5t, t\u0103ng [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4756,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1,29],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4075","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-tin-tuc","category-kien-thuc-tiktok"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4075","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4075"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4075\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5169,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4075\/revisions\/5169"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/4756"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4075"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4075"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4075"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}